    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3eb7bdee6ec44925837df4d175568fa6",
      "statement": "signOut() clears user/session, sets isGuest false, removes localStorage['forceorg_local_user'], then awaits supabase.auth.signOut() inside a try/catch; it clears identity only and leaves any forceorg_rosters_<userId> payloads on disk under the old guest id.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/src/components/AuthProvider.tsx#L153-L165",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:20aef7da55af5c58c38bdb9ad9153b9e9f469a58dd6b4c9a140dea1262214f2a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_682b90afe1d54be99018e9756d91101d",
      "statement": "AuthProvider's initSession awaits supabase.auth.getSession() first and returns early on a session with a user (isGuest false); otherwise it falls through to a window-guarded, try/catch'd read of localStorage['forceorg_local_user'], restoring it as the user with isGuest true only when the JSON parses and carries an id, and finally sets isLoading false. isLoading starts true with no timeout, so a slow or unreachable Supabase host can hold the shell skeleton open.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/src/components/AuthProvider.tsx#L43-L80",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5b0618cee9e7b85ee6bd8efa39f98ea7245a81b565bad4f40404b2b5b4e81ebb:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b815866173394fd3b2c54d2a9c56b02e",
      "statement": "The onAuthStateChange subscription (created on mount against one memoised Supabase client, unsubscribed on cleanup) acts only when newSession is truthy and then forces isGuest false, so a Supabase sign-out or null-session event leaves the previously restored guest user in place; explicit signOut() is the only way to clear it, and isGuest semantically means 'this user came from localStorage' rather than 'no token'.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/src/components/AuthProvider.tsx#L131-L165",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fa0173030b07e5d4c06b58ec4b1469c688e05a455797bfcfca711e04c61e9bc9:"
        },
        {
