      "id": "claim_0dbf6c6a29a046f8be5f8e2f70c6ee35",
      "statement": "src/lib/supabase.ts is a legacy optional auth client: createBrowserClient from @supabase/ssr with NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL || 'https://placeholder.supabase.co' and NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY || 'placeholder-anon-key', and AuthProvider wraps getSession() and signOut() in try/catch, so an unconfigured deployment stays fully functional and callers cannot distinguish offline, misconfigured, and signed-out.",
